<p>Instantly grow a moss circle of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> at your feet.</p><p>Each turn the moss deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> nature damage to each foe within its radius.</p><p>This moss is coated with strange fluids and has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">23%, 31%, 36%, 40%, 44%</acronym> chance to confuse (power <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37%</acronym>) foes passing through it for 2 turns.</p><p>The moss lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 7, 8, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>Moss talents are instant but place all other moss talents on cooldown for 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>